{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a galaxy ruled by the oppressive Unified Order and controlled by the Ministry of Prosperity, the Zogark family dares to defy the system. Now fugitives on the run, they must use their unique skills and ship upgrades to outwit and outrun the relentless Galactic Fleet, fighting for survival and a future where freedom thrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>145+ WEAPON &amp; PASSIVE UPGRADES</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHORT &amp; INTENSE SESSIONS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 PERMANENT UPGRADES</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND MORE...</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC SHIP CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build your ship differently in every run</i>. Choose from a wide variety of 12 Unique Weapons and 12 Unique Modules to suit your playstyle and adapt to ever-changing threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/5a264997f0cf2103c23a2700e1de8b5e.poster.avif?t=1773177219\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/5a264997f0cf2103c23a2700e1de8b5e.webm?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/5a264997f0cf2103c23a2700e1de8b5e.mp4?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISTINCT PLAYABLE CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from multiple members of the Zogark family, <i>each with unique strengths, weaknesses, and special abilities.</i> Find the character that best fits your strategy\u2014or master them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTEGRATED DIALOGUE SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay immersed in the action with a non-intrusive, real-time dialogue system. Characters speak dynamically during gameplay\u2014offering insights, tips, and story moments without breaking the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/be5d232a576ef08148545143f7f4cfb3.poster.avif?t=1773177219\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/be5d232a576ef08148545143f7f4cfb3.webm?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/be5d232a576ef08148545143f7f4cfb3.mp4?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROCEDURALLY GENERATED UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No two runs are the same.</i> Encounter randomized upgrade options throughout your journey, forcing you to adapt your tactics and experiment with powerful new builds each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/f844ae7e0b05d891f2680130f4136893.poster.avif?t=1773177219\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/f844ae7e0b05d891f2680130f4136893.webm?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/f844ae7e0b05d891f2680130f4136893.mp4?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERSISTENT PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn credits during your missions to <i>unlock and upgrade permanent perks.</i> Even when a run ends, your hard-earned progress carries over\u2014making you stronger with every attempt.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Specific Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Run demo delivers a fast-paced, action-packed experience\u00a0~15 min of intense gameplay. <br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770700?t=1773177219","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770700?t=1773177219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/7f00c3af8857f1869e1e4b68c03879edf69d641f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773177219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/7f00c3af8857f1869e1e4b68c03879edf69d641f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773177219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4036820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>STEAM NEXTFEST OCTOBER 2025</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Run Demo is set to launch on in Steam NextFest October!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a galaxy ruled by the oppressive Unified Order and controlled by the Ministry of Prosperity, the Zogark family dares to defy the system. Now fugitives on the run, they must use their unique skills and ship upgrades to outwit and outrun the relentless Galactic Fleet, fighting for survival and a future where freedom thrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>145+ WEAPON &amp; PASSIVE UPGRADES</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHORT &amp; INTENSE SESSIONS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 PERMANENT UPGRADES</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND MORE...</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC SHIP CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build your ship differently in every run</i>. Choose from a wide variety of 12 Unique Weapons and 12 Unique Modules to suit your playstyle and adapt to ever-changing threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/5a264997f0cf2103c23a2700e1de8b5e.poster.avif?t=1773177219\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/5a264997f0cf2103c23a2700e1de8b5e.webm?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/5a264997f0cf2103c23a2700e1de8b5e.mp4?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISTINCT PLAYABLE CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from multiple members of the Zogark family, <i>each with unique strengths, weaknesses, and special abilities.</i> Find the character that best fits your strategy\u2014or master them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTEGRATED DIALOGUE SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay immersed in the action with a non-intrusive, real-time dialogue system. Characters speak dynamically during gameplay\u2014offering insights, tips, and story moments without breaking the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/be5d232a576ef08148545143f7f4cfb3.poster.avif?t=1773177219\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/be5d232a576ef08148545143f7f4cfb3.webm?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/be5d232a576ef08148545143f7f4cfb3.mp4?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROCEDURALLY GENERATED UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No two runs are the same.</i> Encounter randomized upgrade options throughout your journey, forcing you to adapt your tactics and experiment with powerful new builds each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/f844ae7e0b05d891f2680130f4136893.poster.avif?t=1773177219\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/f844ae7e0b05d891f2680130f4136893.webm?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/f844ae7e0b05d891f2680130f4136893.mp4?t=1773177219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERSISTENT PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn credits during your missions to <i>unlock and upgrade permanent perks.</i> Even when a run ends, your hard-earned progress carries over\u2014making you stronger with every attempt.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Specific Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Run demo delivers a fast-paced, action-packed experience\u00a0~15 min of intense gameplay. <br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Zinktank Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"descri